      "widgets_values": [
        "ComfyUI-Qwen3TTS-Bridge\n\nKnown issue: Role Bank intended to allow Roles remaining for easier dialogue. Currently that causes a traceback, so leave Role1 in the bank and use Role1:\"dialogue\" in the prompt for now, it's on the fix list.\n\nKnown issue: Voices saved with Make Voice node may not show up for selection in the Load Voice nodes at first, it's on the fix list.\n\nFurther enhancements and fixes in the next update, so keep an eye out if you find this useful."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "ComfyUI-Qwen3TTS-Bridge\n\nKnown issue: Role Bank intended to allow Roles remaining for easier dialogue. Currently that causes a traceback, so leave Role1 in the bank and use Role1:\"dialogue\" in the prompt for now, it's on the fix list.\n\nKnown issue: Voices saved with Make Voice node may not show up for selection in the Load Voice nodes at first, it's on the fix list.\n\nFurther enhancements and fixes in the next update, so keep an eye out if you find this useful."
      },
